@SimSetup.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5021

### 1. Pobierz listę wszystkich samochodów
GET {{SimSetup.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cars
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Pobierz samochód o ID = 1 (z powiązanymi setupami)
GET {{SimSetup.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cars/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Dodaj nowy samochód (POST)
POST {{SimSetup.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Aston Martin",
  "model": "Vantage AMR GT3",
  "year": 2024
}

###

### 4. Zaktualizuj samochód o ID = 1 (PUT)
PUT {{SimSetup.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "brand": "Ferrari",
  "model": "296 GT3",
  "year": 2023
}

###

### 5. Usuń samochód o ID = 3 (DELETE)
DELETE {{SimSetup.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cars/3
Accept: application/json

###
